
1. OPEN PDF
2. START LOOP (From Page 0 to End):

   3. GET all Text Blocks on the PAGE and SORT them top-to-bottom.

   4. LOOP through every Text Block:

      -------------------------------------------------------
      LOGIC A: DETECT A NEW LESSON (CHAPTER)
      -------------------------------------------------------
      IF (Block starts with "Lezione") AND (Length < 100 characters):
          # apply something better than just he lezione text detection
          
          -> EXTRACT Lesson Number and Name
          -> TRANSLATE Name
          -> INSERT into 'theory_chapters' table
          -> SET 'Current_Chapter_ID' to this new ID
          -> now start detecting the theory cards under this chapter
                -------------------------------------------------------
                LOGIC B: DETECT A THEORY CARD (The actual content)
                -------------------------------------------------------
                ELSE IF (Current_Chapter_ID is set) 
                        AND (Block is UPPERCASE)        <-- e.g., "DOSSO"
                        AND (Block is BOLD)             <-- This often fails in PDFs
                        AND (Block is NOT "Lezione"):

                    -> SET this block as 'CARD TITLE'
                    
                    -> LOOK AT NEXT BLOCK:
                        IF Next Block is normal text:
                            -> SET Next Block as 'CARD BODY'
                    
                    -> SEARCH FOR IMAGE:
                        Get Y-Coordinate (Vertical height) of Title.
                        Loop through all images on page.
                        IF Image Y-Coordinate is close to Title Y-Coordinate:
                            -> UPLOAD Image to Storage
                            -> GET Image URL
                    
                    -> TRANSLATE Title and Body
                    -> INSERT into 'theory_cards' table

          -> PAUSE (Wait for user to click Continue)
      -------------------------------------------------------
      LOGIC C: IGNORE EVERYTHING ELSE
      -------------------------------------------------------
      ELSE:
          Skip block (This is why your descriptions are missing)